	(text "J5 IMU breakout (BMI270 or any SPI IMU): 1 3V3, 2 GND, 3 SCK, 4 MOSI (SDI), 5 MISO (SDO),\n6 CS, 7 INT1, 8 INT2. SPI1 on the MCU. Keep the cable under about 30 cm.\n3V3 comes from SENS_3V3 (F2), so a shorted cable cannot pull down the main 3.3 V rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 109.22 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3202276a-4cb6-4ed5-ba8a-b64b2bffe0a2"))
